  & "shows an empty state with a link to <code>/api/deps</code>)."
  & "</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p><strong>Tree view</strong> (default):</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>Collapsible tree via <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> (root "
  & "open, children closed) with improved"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "text spacing (<code>line-height: 1.65</code>, <code>padding:"
  & " 8px 12px</code>, <code>gap: 10px</code>,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>margin: 6px 0</code>). <strong>Expand all / Collapse a"
  & "ll</strong> buttons.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Filter</strong> input (client-side, case-insensi"
  & "tive by name) hides non-matching"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "nodes. Six <strong>scope checkboxes</strong> (<code>base</co"
  & "de>, <code>dev</code>, <code>transitive</code>, <code>vendor"
