  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>system</code>, <code>test</code> &#8211; all checked b"
  & "y default) hide whole scopes, so vendored,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "dev, system, and test deps can be distinguished and filtered"
  & " where required.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>Scope badges: <code>base</code> (alire.toml), <code>dev<"
  & "/code> (alire-dev.toml only),"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>transitive</code>, <code>vendored</code>, <code>system"
  & "</code> (a tool on <code>PATH</code> the project"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "references, for example <code>git</code> or <code>python3</c"
  & "ode>), and <code>test</code> (declared under a"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>[[test-depends-on]]</code> section, with-claused only "
