  & "ing returns the view to full width.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p><strong>Diagram view</strong> (alternative, toggle <stron"
  & "g>Tree / Diagram</strong>):</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>Rendered with vendored <a href=""https://github.com/skana"
  & "a/nomnoml"">nomnoml 1.7.0</a>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "(MIT, <code>resources/nomnoml.js</code>, 71 KB, inlined) ins"
  & "ide a <code>nomnoml-wrap</code> card.  <code>ADACOVEX_GRAPH<"
  & "/code> (<code>__GRAPH_JSON__</code> injected by the Ada rend"
  & "erer) is converted to nomnoml source (<code>[parent]--&gt;[c"
  & "hild]</code> edges, <code>#direction: down</code> top-to-bot"
  & "tom so deep graphs stay within the page width) and laid out "
  & "with nomnoml&#8217;s internal layout engine, then the graph "
  & "is serialised to an <strong>SVG</strong> (<code>&lt;svg id="""
  & "nomnoml-svg""&gt;</code>). Every node is a real <code>&lt;g d"
  & "ata-name=...&gt;</code> group with a matching <code>&lt;rect"
  & "&gt;</code> hitbox, so boxes are clickable with exact hit ar"
  & "eas (no canvas hit-testing, nothing upside down, no text ove"
