  & "ng to the graph&#8217;s natural size) and is centred horizon"
  & "tally inside <code>.nomnoml-wrap</code>; deep graphs scroll "
  & "inside the card.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Scope checkboxes filter the diagram too (re-render on cha"
  & "nge). Buttons <strong>Re-render</strong> and <strong>Downloa"
  & "d SVG</strong> are provided. The view choice is persisted in"
  & " <code>localStorage</code> (<code>adacovex-dep-view</code>)."
  & "  <strong>Click a box</strong> to open the same split-view d"
  & "etail panel as the Tree view.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p><strong>Two separate searches, similar styling</strong>:<"
  & "/p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Global search</strong> (header, <code>#global-se"
  & "arch</code>) is a site-wide <strong>section"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "index</strong>: at page load it walks the rendered DOM and i"
  & "ndexes each section &#8211;"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "every metric card (labelled by its heading), every complianc"
  & "e-table row,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "every dependency node, and every HLR-tagged element &#8211; "
  & "plus one catch-all"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "entry per tab.  Queries are tokenised and every token must a"
  & "ppear in a"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "section&#8217;s lowercased text (AND semantics), so multi-wo"
  & "rd page text such as"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "&#8220;orphan tags&#8221; or a section heading like &#8220;P"
  & "roof Check Types&#8221; resolves"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "regardless of case.  Selecting a hit switches to that tab an"
  & "d scrolls to"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "(briefly flashing) the exact section, rather than only switc"
  & "hing tabs."
  & ASCII.LF
  & "Dependency names, versions, scopes, licences and PURLs are i"
  & "ndexed too, so"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "the box still filters the dependency tree and seeds <code>de"
  & "p-filter</code>.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Tree filter</strong> (<code>#dep-filter</code>, "
  & "inside the Dependencies tab) is a plain"
