  & "client-side name filter over the rendered tree only &#8211; "
  & "it never touches the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "global index.  The two inputs share the same styling class s"
  & "o they look"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "consistent, but they are functionally independent (typing in"
  & " one does not"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "affect the other until a global hit is clicked).</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The same data is available headlessly at <code>/api/deps<"
  & "/code> and via"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>--emit-metrics=PATH</code> (<code>{""metrics"":..., ""dep"
