  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h3 id=""metrics-charts""><a class=""header"" href=""#metrics-cha"
  & "rts"">Metrics charts</a></h3>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The <strong>Charts</strong> tab renders eight cards and i"
