  & ASCII.LF
  & "or overflow and the ring colour reflects the covered share ("
  & "fully green at"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "100%):</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Robustness</strong> &#8211; the five-axis health"
