  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>SPARK Proof by Check Type</strong> &#8211; the p"
  & "er-category proof radar (Flow,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "Init, Runtime, Assert, Func) shown on the Overview, also sha"
  & "red.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>SPARK Proof</strong> &#8211; <em>donut</em> of p"
