  & "</table>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</div>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h3 id=""api-docs-and-cross-links""><a class=""header"" href=""#a"
  & "pi-docs-and-cross-links"">API docs and cross-links</a></h3>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p><code>make doc</code> regenerates <code>docs/api-docs/</c"
  & "ode> from the <code>.ads</code> docstrings via gnatdoc + <co"
  & "de>tools/rst2md.py</code>. It produces one page per package "
  & "plus <code>index.md</code>. The six hand-written reference p"
  & "ages are never regenerated. They are the docstring spec, the"
  & " test formats, the SPARK levels, and the DAL, ASIL, and Clas"
  & "s level pages.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Cross-links between the generated package pages and the r"
  & "eference pages live in <code>tools/rst2md.py</code>. <code>G"
  & "UIDE_PAGES</code> builds the index&#8217;s &#8220;Guides&#82"
  & "21; section. <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> builds the per-pack"
  & "age &#8220;See also&#8221; lines. They do <strong>not</stron"
  & "g> live in the <code>.ads</code> comments: gnatdoc parses co"
  & "mment text as RST and drops markdown link URLs. To add a pac"
  & "kage cross-link, extend <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> in <code"
  & ">tools/rst2md.py</code>. Then run <code>make doc</code> and "
  & "<code>make link-check</code>.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""testing""><a class=""header"" href=""#testing"">Testing</"
  & "a></h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The test suite is native and zero-dependency. <code>src/t"
  & "ests/</code> holds one file per category (scanner, config, t"
  & "ypes, renderers, SBOM, VCS, and more). Each file exposes a <"
  & "code>Run (R : in out Runner'Class)</code> procedure wired in"
  & "to <code>src/tests/test_runner.adb</code>. A test is a <code"
  & ">R. Check (Condition, ""Description"")</code> call.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The runner counts them, prints a per-category table, and "
  & "writes <code>docs/test_result.md</code>.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<pre><code class=""language-ada"">-- src/tests/adacovex_scanne"
  & "r_tests.adb (pattern to follow)"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "Adacovex.Parsers.Source.Scan_Ads_File (Tmp_File, Pkg, Succes"
  & "s);"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "R.Check (Success, ""Test 1: parse succeeded"");"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</code></pre>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>After adding or removing tests:</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">make test          # rebuil"
  & "d + run; rewrites docs/test_result.md"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "make test-count    # sync every anchored count across the re"
  & "po (AGENTS.md,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "                   # README, Makefile, CI workflows, manifes"
  & "ts, agents-tree.map)"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</code></pre>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The count-sync is enforced by <code>make check</code>. A "
  & "test change that skips the sync fails the gate. Tests write "
  & "to <code>/tmp</code> scratch dirs and clean up after themsel"
  & "ves. The default on-disk result cache (<code>~/.adacovex/cac"
  & "he</code>) is shared.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Tests that exercise caching use content-hashed keys. They"
  & " never depend on each other&#8217;s state.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""documentation-and-dashboard-tooling""><a class=""heade"
  & "r"" href=""#documentation-and-dashboard-tooling"">Documentation"
  & " and dashboard tooling</a></h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The pure-stdlib Python gates keep the docs and the dashbo"
  & "ard in step with"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "the code.  They are the drop-in replacements for the npm too"
  & "ls (stylelint,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "and more) that a JavaScript toolchain would use; adacovex ke"
  & "eps its dev"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "tooling Python-only by convention:</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><code>tools/csslint.py</code> (<code>make csslint-check<"
  & "/code>) enforces the 4px spacing rule:"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "every <code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, and <code>g"
  & "ap</code> pixel length is a multiple of 4px."
  & ASCII.LF
  & "It runs inside <code>make build</code> and <code>make check<"
  & "/code>.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><code>tools/check-docs.py</code> (<code>make docs-check<"
  & "/code>) fails when any paragraph in the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "user docs, README, or human changelogs exceeds four sentence"
  & "s, and it"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations (<code>i.e.</code>"
  & ", <code>e.g.</code>, <code>etc.</code>)."
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>tools/para-split.py</code> rewraps over-long paragraph"
  & "s to comply.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> bundles the dashboar"
  & "d resources into"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> and minifie"
  & "s the authored CSS and"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "JavaScript (comments stripped, whitespace collapsed) before "
  & "inlining.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Edit the dashboard under <code>resources/</code>, never t"
  & "he generated template.  After"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "any docs or resource change, run <code>make docs-check</code"
  & "> and <code>make csslint-check</code>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "before committing.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""spark-proof-discipline""><a class=""header"" href=""#spa"
  & "rk-proof-discipline"">SPARK proof discipline</a></h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p><code>make prove</code> runs gnatprove through the <code>"
  & "prove</code> subcommand and enforces the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "Platinum gate: <strong>0 unproved VCs and 0 justified VCs</s"
  & "trong>. The rules that keep the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "proof tractable:</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>Every user assertion and every runtime check must be pro"
  & "ved.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>No <code>pragma Assume</code> / <code>pragma Annotate</c"
  & "ode> justifications.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>No <code>pragma SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> anywhere except "
  & "<code>Types.Implementation</code> and"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>Complexity</code> (the two non-formal-<code>Ada.Contai"
  & "ners</code> packages. Non-formal"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>Ada.Containers</code> are illegal in SPARK_Mode-On cod"
  & "e &#8211; gnatprove rejects"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "them; the evidence is in <code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</"
  & "code>. <code>make spark-off-check</code> enforces this.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li>I/O- and container-heavy units are default-off bodies or"
  & " carry per-subprogram"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> aspects. They never carry a"
  & "n explicit Off pragma.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The proof result is anchored in <code>docs/proof/</code> "
  & "(the per-version VC ledger)."
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>make proof-status</code> syncs the VC count and SPARK "
  & "level into the docs.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""common-workflows""><a class=""header"" href=""#common-wo"
  & "rkflows"">Common workflows</a></h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Assess another project</strong>: <code>adacovex "
  & "--target=PATH --dal=C</code> (see"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""#target-project-requirements"">Target projects</a>)."
  & "</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Dogfood</strong>: <code>make run-self</code> (ad"
  & "acovex against itself) and <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> (a"
  & "gainst the sibling <code>../Ada_CRDT</code> checkout, strict"
  & " mode). Both"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "must stay green.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Coverage gate between releases</strong>: <code>m"
  & "ake coverage-gate</code> compares docstring"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "coverage between the latest two release tags.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Prepare a release</strong>: <code>make bump-vers"
  & "ion VERSION=x.y.z</code>, write the changelog"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "(<code>docs/changelogs/adacovex-x.y.z.md</code>, canonical f"
  & "ormat enforced by <code>make changelog-check</code>), then <"
  & "code>make release VERSION=x.y.z</code>.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Keep docs current</strong>: every code change up"
  & "dates the relevant user docs,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "the Ada docstrings that feed <code>docs/api-docs</code>, and"
  & " the changelog, then"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "re-runs the sync gates (<code>make docs-check</code>, <code>"
  & "make action-parity-check</code>,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<code>make agents-tree</code>, <code>make doc-links</code>, "
  & "<code>make link-check</code>).  Stale docs are a"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "release blocker.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Debug</strong>: <code>adacovex --verbose</code> "
  & "prints pipeline step diagnostics. <code>adacovex status</cod"
  & "e> reports toolchain + platform state. <code>--no-cache</cod"
  & "e> bypasses the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "on-disk result cache when inputs changed without content cha"
  & "nging.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
