  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""how-to-regenerate""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-to-r"
  & "egenerate"">How to regenerate</a></h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">make prove     # SPARK proo"
  & "f + badges for adacovex itself"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "make run-self   # full self-assessment + badges"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</code></pre>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>The SVG renderer is documented in the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""api-docs/adacovex-renderers-svg.html"">API reference"
  & "</a>.  Badge fields,"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "colours, and shapes are part of the renderer contract; see t"
  & "he"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""api-docs/adacovex_renderer_svg_tests.html"">renderer"
  & " tests</a> for the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "exact expectations.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Badge text uses British English and ASD-STE100 Simplified"
  & " Technical"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "English.  Technical terms follow the <a href=""#ste100-techni"
  & "cal-names-for-adacovex"">STE100 Technical Names"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "dictionary</a>.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<div style=""break-before: page; page-break-before: always;"">"
  & "</div>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h1 id=""adacovex-api-reference""><a class=""header"" href=""#ada"
  & "covex-api-reference"">adacovex API Reference</a></h1>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<h2 id=""how-to-read-this-reference""><a class=""header"" href="""
  & "#how-to-read-this-reference"">How to read this reference</a><"
  & "/h2>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>This reference documents the Ada packages that implement "
  & "adacovex."
  & ASCII.LF
  & "It is generated from the source docstrings by <code>make doc"
  & "</code>.</p>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>End users</strong> need the CLI reference, the d"
  & "ashboard guide, and"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "the standards pages.  The <a href=""#adacovex-cli-reference"">"
  & "CLI reference</a>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "describes every flag.  The <a href=""#compliance-standards-do"
  & "-178c--iso-26262--iec-62304"">standards guide</a>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "explains the compliance levels.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Contributors</strong> use this reference togethe"
  & "r with the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""../CONTRIBUTING.html"">contributing guide</a> and th"
  & "e"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""#adacovex-architecture-decisions"">architecture note"
  & "s</a>.  The <a href=""api-docs/adacovex-docstring-spec.html"">"
  & "docstring"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "spec</a> defines the annotation"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "format.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<li><strong>Maintainers</strong> read the <a href=""#proof-re"
  & "cords"">proof ledger</a> for the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "verified-VC history and the <a href=""#adacovex-changelogs"">c"
  & "hangelogs</a>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "for the release history.</li>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "</ul>"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<p>Technical terms follow the controlled dictionary in"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "<a href=""#ste100-technical-names-for-adacovex"">STE100 Techni"
  & "cal Names</a>.  All"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "documentation, including these pages, uses British English a"
  & "nd"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English.  A word not in the"
  & ASCII.LF
  & "dictionary means the sentence is not yet STE100-clean.</p>"
